-- =====================================================================
-- Level 2 Speaking sentence bank.
--
-- 200 sets of 10 sentences (sets 2-201), disjoint: no sentence appears twice, so no two
-- candidates can ever be served the same set. Sized for 100 users taking 2 attempts each
-- over a year, which is 200 set assignments; SpeakingSetService additionally excludes any
-- set a user has already been served, so nobody repeats their own questions on a retake.
--
-- Seeded through the seed_state marker rather than a row-existence guard. data.sql's own
-- Level 2 insert checks NOT EXISTS (... WHERE level = 2), which is already true in
-- production, so rows appended there would never load on a live database.
-- =====================================================================
